msgctxt "#30075"
msgid "Some apps on this list come in two versions, 32-bit (armeabi-v7a) and 64-bit (arm64-v8a).\n\nThe 32-bit one is for the Fire TV Stick and most TV boxes, and nearly every 64-bit device installs it too without any issue; only a few newer ones, mostly phones, have dropped 32-bit apps. The 64-bit one is for those.\n\nIf in doubt, try the 32-bit one. If the system won't install it, your device is 64-bit only, so download the 64-bit one.\n\nMore apps and help:\n- EspaKodi on Telegram https://t.me/espakodi\n- https://espakodi.github.io/apk/"
